  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Enhancing human security in priority municipalities in Senegal  border regions with the security, climate change and migration  nexus. (Reference Number: UDP-AF-23-008: Senegal)  (PARSH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The programme aims to enhance the integration of the Human Security (HS) approach in the two most susceptible border municipalities of Boki Diaw&#xe9; and Mbolo Birane, located in Senegal&#x2019;s Sahelian zone and the border region with Mauritania. To promote social connectedness 1, the programme will mainstream human security into local planning and community practices for greater citizens&#x2019; participation. It will also aim to strengthen anticipative and prevention planning in local governance with the st</narrative>
  </description>
